},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLTimeOnly":{"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxltimeonly","title":"MXLTimeOnly","fragments":[{"text":"typealias","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MXLTimeOnly","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MXLTimeOnly","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The time-only type is used to indicate that a particular playback- or listening-related element only applies"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"particular times through a repeated section. The value is a list of positive integers arranged in ascending"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"order, indicating which times through the repeated section that the element applies."}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLTimeOnly"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLAssess/timeOnly":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"timeOnly"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"MXLTimeOnly","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL11MXLTimeOnlya"},{"kind":"text","text":"?"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLAssess\/timeOnly","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Restricts the assessment to a set of times through a repeated section."}],"url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlassess\/timeonly","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","title":"timeOnly"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLAssess":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"By default, an assessment application should assess all notes without a cue child element, and not assess any"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"note with a cue child element. The assess type allows this default assessment to be overridden for individual"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"notes. The optional player and time-only attributes restrict the type to apply to a single player or 